{"4312550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Travelling Snailsman", "steam_appid": 4312550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>You're</strong></i><strong> the new Snailsperson!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become one the <i>Snailsfolk,</i> tiny merchant borrowers that live in grasses and forests and have a talent for finding knick-knacks. These miniature folk are known for selling their wares for a precious currency called <i>Snail Coin!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.apng?t=1788284333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.apng?t=1788284333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.apng?t=1788284333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect &amp; sell!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect everything you find while your snail slowly travels between tiny borrower villages where you can sell your wares in an arcade style shop simulation to earn some Snail Coin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2a580e59cff196dfc3aa6a2fe856feac.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2a580e59cff196dfc3aa6a2fe856feac.webm?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2a580e59cff196dfc3aa6a2fe856feac.mp4?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore &amp; upgrade!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned coin on upgrades or decorations for your snail! Ride on your snail's back through the underbrush or fish for rare minnows in the arid sands, explore a variety of different randomly generated areas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/658429801a88b9e43a8da54627814357.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/658429801a88b9e43a8da54627814357.webm?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/658429801a88b9e43a8da54627814357.mp4?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play on the go!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and play for short or long sessions! Designed with Steam Deck in mind, enjoy a high performance experience on portable machines! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/a834f5e3c4abb9982fb2b0baae918bc8.avif?t=1788284333\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snail pet/companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new cosmetic Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopkeeper simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather types</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>You're</strong></i><strong> the new Snailsperson!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become one the <i>Snailsfolk,</i> tiny merchant borrowers that live in grasses and forests and have a talent for finding knick-knacks. These miniature folk are known for selling their wares for a precious currency called <i>Snail Coin!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.apng?t=1788284333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.apng?t=1788284333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.apng?t=1788284333\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2d4f6c14c4f27b9f217520b02d23a784.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect &amp; sell!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect everything you find while your snail slowly travels between tiny borrower villages where you can sell your wares in an arcade style shop simulation to earn some Snail Coin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2a580e59cff196dfc3aa6a2fe856feac.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2a580e59cff196dfc3aa6a2fe856feac.webm?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/2a580e59cff196dfc3aa6a2fe856feac.mp4?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore &amp; upgrade!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned coin on upgrades or decorations for your snail! Ride on your snail's back through the underbrush or fish for rare minnows in the arid sands, explore a variety of different randomly generated areas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/658429801a88b9e43a8da54627814357.poster.avif?t=1788284333\" width=1170 height=750 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/658429801a88b9e43a8da54627814357.webm?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/658429801a88b9e43a8da54627814357.mp4?t=1788284333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play on the go!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and play for short or long sessions! Designed with Steam Deck in mind, enjoy a high performance experience on portable machines! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/extras/a834f5e3c4abb9982fb2b0baae918bc8.avif?t=1788284333\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snail pet/companion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new cosmetic Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopkeeper simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather types</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Become a tiny Snailsman in this cozy merchant adventure! Bond with your trusty snail as you find nifty items in the underbrush. Meet travelling folk and sell your newly found wares to buy upgrades and decorations for your snail!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/30ec2533e24e2bf57f589a3e2bcf9f1a97fa338e/header.jpg?t=1788284333", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/c6d2425c32754f79610a40a38a1e490252d2c196/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788284333", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/c6d2425c32754f79610a40a38a1e490252d2c196/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788284333", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2 GHz processor, 2 GB RAM, and Support for OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any modern Linux distribution (e.g., Ubuntu 18.04+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any modern x86 or ARM processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 Compatible</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Scrambled Software"], "publishers": ["Scrambled Software"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/b8df4dfaf5c077d0ec68e823dd91d658c5c7d72c/ss_b8df4dfaf5c077d0ec68e823dd91d658c5c7d72c.600x338.jpg?t=1788284333", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4312550/b8df4dfaf5c077d0ec68e823dd91d658c5c7d72c/ss_b8df4dfaf5c077d0ec68e823dd91d658c5c7d72c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788284333"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.ak